this.add({id:1519, 
title:"", 
body:" the costs associated with azure blob storage scanning related following netskope services, data egress storage accounts event grid notification webhook api calls list blobs inside storage accounts api calls read properties blobs inside storage accounts the cost determined number notifications netskope receives webhook. notification event blob created, renamed deleted. " });
this.add({id:1520, 
title:"Sample billing", 
body:" sample billing consider netskope receives 100 notifications second month. the number month calculated as, number notifications month = 100*60*60*24*30 260 million. consider 50% notifications result policy match. therefore, file downloaded sent dlp malware scanning. number files scanned month = 130 million. if average file size 2mb, data downloaded month 250tb. in example, following costs ongoing scans month. data egress cost internet: 0.01*250*1024 = $2560 to learn more: https:\/\/azure.microsoft.com\/en-in\/pricing\/details\/storage\/blobs\/ event grid notification cost: (260,000,000 - 100,000)\/1,000,000*0.6 = $156 to learn more: https:\/\/azure.microsoft.com\/en-in\/pricing\/details\/event-grid\/ cost api calls metadata blobs: 130,000,000\/10000*0.005 = $65 to learn more: https:\/\/azure.microsoft.com\/en-in\/pricing\/details\/storage\/blobs\/ consider want run retroscan incur additional costs services list api calls, properties egress. if retrsocan lists 100 million objects 50% downloaded scan matching policies, 50 million files with average file size 2mb. the following retroscan costs month. data egress cost internet: 0.01*100*1024 = $1024 cost api calls metadata blobs: 50,000,000\/10000*0.005 = $25 cost listing apis: 50,000,000\/10000*0.005 = $25 to learn more: https:\/\/azure.microsoft.com\/en-in\/pricing\/details\/storage\/blobs\/ " });
