this.add({id:2031, 
title:"Configure Netskope to Access your Atlassian Confluence account", 
body:" configure netskope access atlassian confluence account to authorize netskope access atlassian confluence account, follow steps below: log netskope tenant ui: https:\/\/<tenant hostname>.goskope.com settings > api-enabled protection saas >nextgen . under apps , select confluence click setup confluence instance . the setup instance window opens. under site domain , enter fully-qualified domain atlassian account (example: mycompany.atlassian.net). click grant access . you redirected atlassian sign-in page. login with atlassian site-admin account. review permissions requested. to know permissions, see permissions required confluence . on authorize for: drop-down list, select site domain entered step 3. click accept . when configuration results page opens, click close . refresh browser see green check icon instance name. you receive audit events standard user behavior analytic alerts skope it. to know more: next generation . " });
this.add({id:2032, 
title:"Permissions Required for Atlassian Confluence", 
body:" permissions required atlassian confluence when grant access atlassian confluence app instance, netskope seeks consent following permissions account: permissions required netskope description purpose offline_access scope getting refresh token. periodically refresh access token instance setup. read:audit-log:confluence view export audit records confluence events. retrieve list confluence audit log events skope it > application events . you need permission support features like behavior analytics. read:confluence-user view user information confluence access to, including usernames, email addresses, profile pictures. retrieve list confluence users inventory\/users. you need permission support features like dlp. read:content-details:confluence view details regarding content associated properties. same above. in addition, need scope searching confluence users. read:confluence-groups permits retrieval user groups. (future release) retrieve list confluence groups inventory\/user groups. you need permission support features like dlp. read:confluence-space.summary read summary space information expansions. (future release) retrieve list confluence spaces inventory\/content collection. you need permission support features like dlp. read:confluence-content.permission view content permission confluence. (future release) calculate content exposure inventory like confluence page. read:confluence-content.all read content including body (expansions permitted). (future release) retrieve restrictions piece content support exposure calculation. read:confluence-content.summary read summary content expansions. (future release) retrieve pages scanning. readonly:content.attachment:confluence download attachments confluence page blog-post access to. (future release) download page attachment scanning. write:confluence-content permits creation pages, blogs, comments, questions. (future release) tombstone sensitive text content. to make copy page legal hold. write:confluence-file upload attachments. (future release) replace sensitive file with tombstone file. to upload attachments pages legal hold. " });
