this.add({id:2347, 
title:"Create App Configuration and Deploy", 
body:" create app configuration deploy in ms endpoint manager admin center, apps > app configuration policy click + add select managed devices . in basics section create app configuration policy page, enter following details click next . name : give policy platform : android enterprise associated app : select netskope client in settings section create app configuration policy page, locate configuration settings select use configuration designer option configuration settings format dropdown list . click add select following mandatory values click ok . user email address : {{mail}} host : <addon-hostname> token : <organization key> locating your organization id the organization id case-sensitive. login tenant with admin credentials. click settings > security cloud platform > mdm distribution . in mdm distribution page, scroll create vpn configuration section organization id . ns_mdm_check optional value used android device classification purpose. if doing android,you safely ignore field. in assignments section create app configuration policy page, select groups assign dropdown menu policy applied. assuming option selected was selected groups, select include azure ad groups policy apply click next . you select groups excluded configuration policy. in review + create section create app configuration policy page, review configuration click create . enroll android devices intune company portal application available google play. " });
