this.add({id:2845, 
title:"Reset the Super Admin Password", 
body:" reset super admin password to reset super admin password perform steps machine running docker containers. run command make note container id bitnami\/monogodb . sudo docker container ls enter mongodb docker container. sudo docker exec -ti <container id> sh log mongodb client. mongo --username root\nenter password: when prompted password, enter password defined docker-compose.yml mongodb_root_password. switch ce database run command. use cte enter following line reset admin password. db.users.update({username: \"admin\"}, {$set: {password: \"$2y$12$rbcv6xwfhhucm4a1yrmqxuezhqz9nadpmuzib6xeixohg.qzngiio\"}}); admin password reset default. log netskope cloud exchange ui with default username password admin\/admin , change password. " });
this.add({id:2846, 
title:"Logging", 
body:" logging an admin user view search audit logs. audit logs track significant events occur operation netskope ce. logs provide important information troubleshooting any abnormal behaviors errors occur. searched ce ui, export local system. click logging left panel. logs entries displayed. by default, log sorted descending order occurrence. filters set search specific log entries. the filter parameters listed below: field description filter operators message log message. is equal contains (regex supported). type log type (info, warning, error). any in, operator (multiselect) created at time log created. !=, <, >, >= you export logs clicking export . " });
