this.add({id:2851, 
title:"AWS S3 Plugin for Log Shipper", 
body:" aws s3 plugin log shipper\n this document explains how configure aws s3 integration with log shipper module netskope cloud exchange platform. allows pushing web transactions buckets. prerequisites a netskope tenant (or multiple, example, production development\/test instances). a netskope cloud exchange tenant with log shipper module configured. aws s3 credentials with create\/read\/write buckets permissions. obtain access key id secret key permission read\/write specific create proceeding. verify bucket permissions secure set open public access. only allow access cloud storage instance your cloud exchange host any addresses need workflow create bucket, iam user policy, obtain required credentials. configure aws s3 plugin. configure log shipper business rules. configure log shipper siem mappings. validate plugin. " });
