this.add({id:2889, 
title:"Configure the GCP Cloud Storage Plugin", 
body:" configure gcp cloud storage plugin go settings > plugins. select google cloud storage box open plugin creation dialog. enter configuration name. click next . enter key file google cloud storage account. enter globally unique bucket name. select region name dropdown (the location used storing objects). if want know buckets regions, refer to: https:\/\/cloud.google.com\/storage\/docs\/locations . select storage class dropdown (based gcp storage class cost). if want know storage class, refer to: https:\/\/cloud.google.com\/storage\/docs\/storage-classes . enter object prefix. the prefix used creating file prefix) enter maximum file size (in mbs, value 0 100). default value 10 mb. enter maximum duration (in seconds, value positive integer). click save . " });
