this.add({id:3610, 
title:"About Watchlists", 
body:" about watchlists you create manage watchlists monitor specific events application events page events. to create watchlist: create search query entering bar. for example, want view any users accessing cloud apps with low ccl, skope it search query field enter user eq 'username@domain.com' ccl 'low' . to right search bar, click icon. the create watchlist dialog box opens. enter watchlist click save . you create maximum 10 watchlists. to manage watchlist: go home page, click edit button, click add widgets view widget library. enter \"watchlist\" widget library search bar. click watchlist widget drag home page. the widget library search bar case-sensitive. to delete watchlist, home page view watchlist widget, select want delete. " });
