this.add({id:3616, 
title:"Industry Benchmarks Dashboard", 
body:" industry benchmarks dashboard the industry benchmarks dashboard provides comparative analysis netskope operational metrics customer’s environment customers, industry peers. this dashboard delivers following: provides overview organization’s exposure risk assesses security posture organization compared similar-sized industry peers identifies security gaps evidence-based decision making strategy resource allocation tracks score progress time this dashboard view only; copying, editing, drilldowns enabled. calculating the score the overall score average score risk areas (weighted equally). this computed daily comparison with previous 7 day’s provided. industry organization assigned based information collected onboarding. size determined number active unique users observed events netskope endpoint log data. the score, risk areas, reported following manner; additional details provided individual sections. your risk score : percentile 7 day rolling average calculated raw percentage industry organizations size (i.e. count malware md5 hash divided total number events threat activities) industry peers risk score : percentile average calculated percentage organizations current industry average risk score across cloud : average computed score industries threat activities threat activities computes risk score based malware malsites. this section’s takes average following: malware - total number malware files detected divided total events malsite - total number malicious sites blocked divided total web events application risk application risk computes risk score based unmanaged risky applications. section's calculated total number non enterprise-ready applications (applications with ‘medium’, ‘low’, ‘poor’ ccl) divided use. this score excludes any application tagged ‘sanctioned’; continue review tag applications improve score. a breakdown applications ccl, custom tags provides additional insight app usage. this table based aggregate data past week. the overall total number unsanctioned risky main contributors risk score. the second table breaks count applications use missing key attributes. to learn cloud confidence index level assigned, see cloud confidence index . user risk user risk computes score based behavioral analytics policy violations. this section's calculated total number users with ueba the chart provides detailed breakdown individual policies. please note ueba policies come with predefined parameters; additional criteria specified provide accurate reading. to learn how fine tune based recommended settings, see rule-based policies ml based policies . improving your score the following recommendations improve score: identify users tied risky activities implement coaching policies alter behavior facilitate security awareness training repeating offenders; facilitate ‘risk intelligent culture’ raise leverage dashboards netskope library gain visibility; monitor risky user behavior data movements unsanctioned shadow it applications. " });
