this.add({id:3677, 
title:"Filtered Widgets", 
body:" filtered widgets the widgets provide view latency data usage using graphs. you use filters page select event timestamp, netskope pop, applications want data. the client netskope pop latency widget shows average round trip time end user's device netskope pop. it does account processing client similarly, netskope pop app latency widget shows average round trip time observed netskope pop destination application. it does account platform's processing time. the uploaded & downloaded bytes shows average number bytes uploaded downloaded end users. this graph help identify peak durations network traffic. using data, monitor traffic sudden spikes, manage infrastructure maintenance window off-peak hours. the hourly traffic volume by pop shows total number bytes sent pop hour day. you use access method filter page view data specific traffic steering method. the unique active users per hour by pop shows number unique active users connected single pop hour day. you use access method filter page view data specific traffic steering method. the storage scan consumption by month shows volume data scanned gb month netskope supported public cloud resources. " });
